WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.650
Turn into dust! Vector!

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.420
He did it, Shark won!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:39.680
It can't be... I'm the one... who <i>lost</i>!?

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.350
Just like last time, Vector.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.310
What did you say!?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:50.770
When I confronted you here in the past, when you lost the Duel,

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.310
then...

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:58.440
the wandering souls of those you murdered gathered here, carrying their resentment and sorrow...

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.410
And ended up dragging you to Hell.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.960
Don't screw with me... I...!

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.340
<i>Vector!</i>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.910
Wha... what's going on!?

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.470
Sto... stop... STOP IT!

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.730
No matter when or where the evil is,...

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.930
... drowning in its own power, it will end up destroying itself.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.620
This isn't going to be the same as back then...

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:32.170
... Nasch!

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:43.170
I'm currently stronger than the Seven Barian Emperors or even Don Thousand!

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:47.660
If I'm going down, you're coming with me!

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.460
He still has this much power...!

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.180
This is my power!

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.640
I may as well be a <i>God</i> with this power!

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.520
Do not misunderstand, Vector.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.730
This is not your power!

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.690
Do- Don Thousand!?

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:20.570
You... I burned you to ashes!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.790
Vector, you damn...

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:30.000
Did you really think you could do that much?

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:34.420
I was merely waiting for this opportunity.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:40.010
The time has come! Vector, you've outlived your usefulness!

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:43.970
That power belongs to me!

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:49.630
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:54.870
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.560
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:10.740
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.560
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.540
the feelings I want to express.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:30.560
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.810
Right now, with you

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.740
Oh - By facing each other,

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:44.820
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.920
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:55.350
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:00.520
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:10.100
...on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:27.620
<i>"The Embodiment of Chaos, "Don Thousand" Has Come!!"</i>

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.200
Stop!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.090
Stop! Just STOP!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.340
I can't... I can't die like this!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:44.930
Vector!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.350
Yuma!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.100
What are you doing!?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.110
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.990
Are you okay?! Hold on!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.280
Don't let go!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.450
Yuma...

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.000
You're trying to help your mortal enemy, Vector, Tsukumo Yuma?

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.920
Don't, Yuma!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.630
You'll end up being sucked in as well!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:23.420
I know, but I couldn't live with myself if I didn't try n' help him!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.470
Knock it off, Yuma! That guy has no soul!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.430
Even if you help him, he'll just stab you in the back again!

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:33.390
Then... Then I'll just believe in him one more time!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.600
Even if he has no heart or soul, I honestly believe he can have one!

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.900
'Cause that's how I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.230
Yuma...

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.570
Vector, even you have a good heart.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.110
You showed it when you were Shingetsu!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:55.000
You were a cheerful, nosy jerk who and though you caused me a ton o' grief, everyone loved you.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.120
You were our friend!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.540
The real you was how you were when you were Shingetsu Rei!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.840
I am Shingetsu.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.170
Right, you're Shingetsu!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.260
So start over, as Shingetsu!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.680
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.680
Then...

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.560
Let's go down with this ship together!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.190
Die by my side, YUMA!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:25.780
Yuma!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.940
NO!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.700
Now c'mon over here!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.000
Yeah, let's do it, Shingetsu.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.460
You are not alone.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.840
I'll protect you.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.880
Yuma...

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.510
<i>Shingetsu, from today on, you're one of us guys!</i>

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.390
<i>I won't leave anyone behind!</i>

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.930
<i>I'll protect you, okay?</i>

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.690
Shingetsu?

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:04.860
You're a ridiculously simple soul. It's ridiculous.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.490
But I can't drag you down with me.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.490
Hey, Shingetsu!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.780
This is farewell.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.250
Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.840
SHINGETSU!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:39.810
Now Vector's power is mine.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.190
I'll never forgive you!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.980
There's no way in hell I'll forgive you for this, Don Thousand!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.480
Foolish boy...

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.700
My power has returned!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.620
What? What's going on now?!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:08.000
Behold, the dawn of a new world!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:20.850
This is...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.600
What on earth...!?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.860
I have merged everything into one world.

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:35.200
I have just fused your world and the Barian World together with my powers.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:39.040
Look behind you, Tsukumo Yuma.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.410
That's...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.920
Right. This is the part of Earth where you live.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:50.630
I did say the worlds have become one.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.060
You're...

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:04.980
Mizael!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.730
Tsukumo Yuma.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.230
Mizael...

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.400
Kaito's... He's really...?

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.360
Yes.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:17.200
Kaito used up the last of his strength to beat me.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:22.330
Yes, at the birthplace of the Galaxy-Eyes.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.790
He entrusted me with this card.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.000
This card is... "Numeron Dragon".

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.340
I'm entrusting Kaito's momento with you.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.930
Kaito... But why me?

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.970
Kaito believed in the future.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.930
And that future is you.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.560
Mizael...

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:45.980
Nasch.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.150
We, the Seven Emperors, as human beings,

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:54.070
had our memories altered by Don Thousand, and were dragged down into the Barian World.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.610
As a means to revive him and restore his power.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.950
The future Don Thousand is weaving...

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:06.750
... is not the future we dream of.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.790
Mizael, you...!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.580
Do not interfere!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.800
Just watch with your eyes, one and all, upon my Duel!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.720
Mizael.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.800
even though you've lost your powers as a Barian,

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:25.930
... you dare challenge me?

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:30.650
This me, who is once more the equal of a God?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.360
Th... that's Don Thousand's...

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.320
True form!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.320
Don Thousand!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.950
Now, come, let us fight fairly, like men!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.000
Duel Disk, set!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.790
Very well.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.210
You, too, shall become my bread.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.720
Duel!!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.600
Mizael...

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.390
I shall go first.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.520
My turn. Draw!

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.690
And with this, I shall end my turn.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:16.940
What?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.320
You're ending your turn without doing anything!?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.910
Now, it's your turn, so give me what you've got.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:29.250
Let me show you my Duel, one which I put my entire body and soul into!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.540
My turn! Draw!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.420
I Summon Heliosphere, the Supreme-Shield Dragon!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.260
Next, I activate the Spell Card Galactic Imperial Wrath!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.270
At the cost of giving up my Battle,

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:55.270
I Special Summon one Level Four or lower Dragon-Type monster from my hand!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.230
Come forth, Radius, the Half-Moon Dragon!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:04.240
I Overlay my Level Four Heliosphere and Radius!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.290
And now I build the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.040
Xyz Summon!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:15.330
Reveal yourself, Galaxy Stealth Dragon!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.630
I activate Stealth Dragon's effect!

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:27.890
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can Special Summon one Dragon-Type monster from my hand!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.060
I'll detach both of its Overlay Units...

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.310
...and Special Summon these two Monsters!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.820
Show yourselves! Schwarzchild Limit Dragon!

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.780
Parsec, the Interstellar Dragon!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.820
Amazing! He dropped three Monsters onto the field just like that!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.910
But Mizael can't battle this turn.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:50.910
No.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.200
He's probably...

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.580
Don Thousand, behold.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:01.210
The final trump card of a Dragon Tamer!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.840
I activate a Spell! Passing of the Dragon Emperor!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:10.310
This card releases every monster I control on the field!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:15.560
And then the combined Attack Power of all the released monsters

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.940
is inflicted to both players.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.730
Don't! Mizael, you'll...!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.610
Do you intend to take Don Thousand down with you!?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.200
Don't do it! Mizael!!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:31.870
In exchange for my life, with the bonds of friendship with my dragons...

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.660
... I will drag you to Hell!!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.380
Taste 4800 points of damage!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.340
Mizael!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.100
How can this be?!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.690
Mizael, please take a look at your field.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.150
That's...! It can't be! The card...

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.730
Card of the Dragon Emperor? The card was changed...!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:08.780
But why? I definitely activated Passing of the Dragon Emperor...!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:15.660
But the activated card on your field is clearly Card of the Dragon Emperor.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.710
All Dragon-Type monsters you control are released...

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.630
And then I draw that many cards from my deck...

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.970
But the combined Attack Points of the released monsters...

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:31.140
will be inflicted to me as damage.

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.890
What the heck is even goin' on!?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:37.140
Your loss, I'm afraid, Mizael.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:42.060
Therefore, you take 4800 damage.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.580
Mizael!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.580
You dumb jerk! Why'd you do something so stupid!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.420
Because I found something to believe in.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:10.510
I believed in Kaito and the rest of you. I learned to believe in others.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.100
Nasch, Yuma, Astral.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.730
Please finish this.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.400
Mizael...!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:38.040
You are now the only one of the Seven Emperors remaining, Nasch.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.960
Now, you should come and return to me.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:47.000
Inside me, there are already are...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.970
... the souls of billions of Barians!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:52.470
And some of them...

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:57.810
... are those of your friends who fell fighting this war.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.690
Also, Astral, Tsukumo Yuma.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.310
I shall also feast upon your souls.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:11.490
I will obtain all your powers and become a <i>True God</i>.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.280
None of you will escape from here.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.450
You impudent worms shall become a feast for me.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.880
Now, let this Duel of sacrifices begin.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.840
Together, we'll...

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.800
...Duel against you?!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.220
Mizael...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.600
He risked his life to tell us.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:43.190
We've to go beyond who is our friend and who is our enemy, and trust each other.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.980
Now, that we have to face such a powerful enemy.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.520
Shark.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.980
And Yuma.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.610
Let's fight together!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.280
Shark. Let's do this together!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.660
I'll avenge my friends and comrades!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.830
It's time to settle this once and for all, Don Thousand!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.880
Do it, guys!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.260
Duel Disk, set!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.350
D-Gazer, set!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.100
Duel!!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.900
Astral, I have been waiting for this moment.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:38.160
You <i>odious worm</i>, I will bring you to your knees and smash you into pieces.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.370
My turn! Draw!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.960
And now, I end my turn.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.210
He did nothing again...?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.670
Watch out.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.590
Don Thousand is the strongest enemy we'll ever fight.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.930
There's some trick to this Duel.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.390
Got it.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:04.140
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.100
I Special Summon Toy Knight!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:13.530
If there ain't any monsters on my field, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.740
And now I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:28.420
I Overlay my Level Four Toy Knight and Gagaga Magician!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.830
Xyz Summon!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:36.920
Come on out, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:41.260
Take a good look, Don Thousand!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.180
This is our hope!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.180
<i>Hope</i>, you say?

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:52.270
Do you worms really believe in something like that?

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.530
What!? Hope was...!?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:04.530
Why?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.160
Ganbara Knight was Summoned!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:08.910
What in the world is going on?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.790
What the hell have you done?!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:18.010
I activated the Counter Trap, Numeron Rewriting Xyz, from my Deck.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.260
You activated a Trap Card from your Deck?!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.180
And during my turn to boot?!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.810
This Counter Trap Card, when I control no other cards on my field,

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:31.480
allows me to negate the Xyz Summon of an opponent's Xyz Monster and destroy it,

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.900
and then chooses a monster from my opponent's Deck,

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.780
negates its effects and Special Summons it on the opponent's field.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.820
With this effect, the fact that Hope was Summoned...

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.240
... was rewritten.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:48.080
Rewrote... Numeron...

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.960
It can't be! It couldn't possibly be the power of the Numeron Code!?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.590
No way! Why does he...?!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.090
Correct!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.550
This is the power of the Numeron Code!

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:07.310
This entire world has become a Field Spell Card I activated, Numeron Network!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:14.150
Once per turn, Numeron Network, if I control no other cards,

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:18.400
allows me to activate a card with the power of the Numeron Code from my Deck.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.740
So when you were Dueling Mizael...

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:25.410
Again, correct. Using the power of Numeron Network,

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:30.540
I activated the Counter Trap Card Numeron Rewriting Magic.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.080
It allowed me to negate the activation of a Spell Card,

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:39.460
and instead activate a Spell Card from the opponent's deck, whose activation requirements could be met.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.430
So you rewrote Mizael's card?

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:48.350
No way! Then, he can rewrite anything Yuma and the others do!

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.600
So Don Thousand is actually the power of the Numeron Code?!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:53.520
That's impossible!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:57.060
No one has all the Numbers yet.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.280
The Numeron Code is hidden somewhere on Earth...

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.070
Don't tell me that he...

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:09.030
The Earth now holds the power of the Numeron Code?!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.200
It looks like you finally figured it out, Astral.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.710
Sure I don't know where the Numeron Code's resting place is.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:23.510
So I made The Earth a part of the Barian World,

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.300
to gain the power of the Numeron Code.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.180
Don Thousand!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:35.940
With the power of the Numeron Code, I am now truly a "God"!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.780
Allowing me to attack the Astral World directly!

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.030
The Astral World...

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:50.330
Correct. And whenever you impertinent worms take damage,

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:53.410
the Astral World will also take damage!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.120
What did you say!?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:22:01.000
With this Duel, I'm going to destroy both you fools and the Astral World!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:08.340
Taste the power of my Numeron Deck, as I destroy you!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.270
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.020
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.080
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.300
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:49.220
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:54.560
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:59.390
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.280
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.440
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.820
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.700
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.450
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:21.920
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.040
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.880
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.300
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:46.360
After he materialized the power of the four Numbers, the world faces yet another danger!

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.610
And in order to eliminate them,

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:51.700
Astral drives the Numeron Code toward himself!

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:53.740
I will settle this once and for all!

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:55.580
a God-made Number?!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.700
Astral! You can't be...!

00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:59.790
I leave everything to you two.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.670
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:05.170
"Cut Open a Path to the Future - Astral's Determination!!"

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:08.210
Why do you have to be the only one to sacrifice himself?!
